
   Imagine you are at a horse track.  You have money in your pocket and
feel the urge to gamble.  When you "Go to the Track!" you will be shown
a screen containing the horse names for the race and the odds for each
to win, place or show.
   You will be allowed to bet on a horse to win, place and to show but
need not bet on all three.  If you do not wish to bet on a horse for
any one category, simply press return at that prompt.  The maximum bet
at BBSDowns is $2000 on each horse you select to win, place, or show.
   Once you have placed all your bets the race will begin.  The horses
will be shown racing across the screen from the starting position to
the finish line.  As each horse crosses the finish line the win, place
and show horses will be recorded and your bets will be paid off if you
have won.
   A high scores list is kept which contains the account balances of
everyone who has bet at the track. If you are lucky enough (and its all
luck right?) to make a million dollars here at the track then the owner
will add your name to that elite group called the "Millionaires Club"
